direction: right
title: Java Generics PECS Rule: Producer Extends, Consumer Super

Producer: Producer Extends (? extends Number) {
  style.fill: "#0B132B"
  style.stroke: "#0284C7"
  read: "Number n = list.get(0) [Safe Covariant Read]"
  write: "list.add(10) [COMPILATION ERROR! Type unknown]"
  rule: "Use 'extends' when reading data OUT of collection"
}

Consumer: Consumer Super (? super Integer) {
  style.fill: "#1C1917"
  style.stroke: "#F59E0B"
  write: "list.add(42) [Safe Contravariant Write]"
  read: "Object o = list.get(0) [Restricted to Object]"
  rule: "Use 'super' when putting data INTO collection"
}

Producer <-> Consumer: Dual Variance Symmetries
